  },
  "description": "Redpanda v1: native broker metrics (request rate per topic, consumer group lag, broker self-metrics) scraped from /public_metrics, plus Polaris-side publish-failure rate as a proxy for ingester-to-Redpanda failures. See infra/prometheus/prometheus.yml (job polaris-redpanda).",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Polaris Redpanda\n\nNative Redpanda metrics come from the `/public_metrics` endpoint on the admin listener (see `infra/prometheus/prometheus.yml`, job `polaris-redpanda`). Common series:\n\n- `redpanda_kafka_request_bytes_total{topic, redpanda_request}` — throughput per topic\n- `redpanda_kafka_consumer_group_lag{group, topic, partition}` — lag per consumer group\n- `redpanda_kafka_request_latency_seconds` — broker-side request latency histogram\n- `up{job=\"polaris-redpanda\"}` — scrape health\n\n**Polaris-side proxy.** Redpanda doesn't surface a per-producer publish-failure counter. The closest signal is the ingester's batch-rejection-with-`reason=publish_failed` counter — included below as the v1 publish-failure rate.\n\n**Known gaps** (P10-003):\n\n- If your Redpanda build doesn't expose `redpanda_kafka_consumer_group_lag` natively, the v1 lag signal falls back to `polaris_processor_lag_ms_last` from the processors dashboard.\n- No broker health roll-up exists yet; the `up{job=\"polaris-redpanda\"}` stat at the top of this dashboard is the v1 sentinel.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": { "color": "red", "index": 0, "text": "DOWN" },
                "1": { "color": "green", "index": 1, "text": "UP" }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "up{job=\"polaris-redpanda\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "broker {{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Broker scrape health",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5 },
          "unit": "Bps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 18, "x": 6, "y": 6 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (rate(redpanda_kafka_request_bytes_total{redpanda_request=\"produce\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Produce throughput per topic (5m, bytes/s)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5 },
          "unit": "Bps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (rate(redpanda_kafka_request_bytes_total{redpanda_request=\"fetch\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Fetch throughput per topic (5m, bytes/s)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["max", "lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (group, topic) (redpanda_kafka_consumer_group_lag)",
          "legendFormat": "{{group}} / {{topic}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Consumer group lag (records, per group/topic)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5 },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 26 },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(polaris_ingest_batch_rejected_total{reason=\"publish_failed\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "publish failures (proxy)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Publish failure rate (proxy from ingester rejects, 5m)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 30000 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 120000 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 26 },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["max"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "max by (topic_family, processor_name) (polaris_processor_lag_ms_last{environment=\"$environment\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic_family}} / {{processor_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Per-family processor lag (proxy when native consumer_group_lag unavailable, ms)",
      "type": "stat"
    }
  ],
